{
  "key": 50243,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_WhatsGoingOn",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What’s going on...?\r",
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Qu’est-ce qui se \n",
        "passe...?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_MakeTimeAndSpaceMine",
      "en_US": [
        "...The flowing time...\n",
        "...The expanding space...\r",
        "I will make it all mine one day...\n",
        "Cyrus is my name. Remember it...\r",
        "Until then, sleep while you can,\n",
        "legendary Pokémon of the lake bed...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le temps qui s’écoule...\n",
        "L’espace en perpétuelle expansion...\r",
        "Tout ça m’appartiendra, un jour...\n",
        "Hélio est mon nom. Rappelez-vous-en...\r",
        "D’ici là, dormez tant que vous le pouvez\n",
        "encore, Pokémon légendaires des lacs...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_AllowMeToPass",
      "en_US": [
        "Allow me to pass.\n",
        "Step aside.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Laissez-moi passer.\n",
        "Hors de mon chemin.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_WhatWasThatAbout",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What was that about?\n",
        "Weird guy...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: C’est quoi son problème?\n",
        "Maboul, va...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_LetsCatchThatLegendary",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Let’s catch that legendary Pokémon!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "OK, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Capturons ce Pokémon légendaire!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_LegendaryCry",
      "en_US": "Kyauuun!\r",
      "fr_FR": "Follééé!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_ThatWasTheLegendaryCrying",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: !\n",
        "Did you hear that, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?!\r",
        "That was the legendary Pokémon crying!\n",
        "That had to be it!\r",
        "OK! This is our chance!\n",
        "Let’s catch it!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: !\n",
        "T’as entendu ça, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?!\r",
        "C’était le cri du Pokémon légendaire!\n",
        "C’est obligé!\r",
        "OK! C’est le moment ou jamais!\n",
        "Attrapons-le!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_WaitWeDontHavePokeballs",
      "en_US": [
        "...Wait!\n",
        "What...?!\r",
        "We don’t have anything on us!\r",
        "You know, Poké Balls!\n",
        "P-O-K-accent-E Balls!\r",
        "If we don’t have those, we can’t catch\n",
        "Pokémon or take them around with us!\r",
        "...Do you think Prof. Rowan’d give us\n",
        "some if we asked him?\r",
        "You know, you remember what he said,\n",
        "don’t you?\r",
        "He said to visit him at his lab if we\n",
        "needed anything.\r",
        "OK, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "I’ll race you!\r",
        "First one to the professor’s lab in\n",
        "Sandgem Town rules!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Attends!\n",
        "On n’est pas du tout équipés!\r",
        "Ben oui, on n’a pas de Poké Balls, quoi!\n",
        "P-O-K-E accent aigu Balls!\r",
        "Sans Poké Balls, on ne risque pas de\n",
        "capturer des Pokémon!\r",
        "Tu crois que le Professeur Sorbier nous\n",
        "en donnerait quelques-unes?\r",
        "Tu te rappelles de ce qu’il a dit?\r",
        "Comme quoi on pouvait venir le voir au\n",
        "labo en cas de besoin.\r",
        "OK, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "On fait la course!\r",
        "Le premier arrivé au labo de Littorella\n",
        "a gagné!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_RowanNoLegendaryHowWasLakeValor",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hmmm...\r",
        "No legendary Pokémon, nothing out\n",
        "of the ordinary...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how was Lake Valor?\n",
        "Anything to report?\r",
        "What? You’re just going there now?\n",
        "You’ve got to move faster than that!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Hum...\r",
        "Pas de Pokémon légendaire, \n",
        "rien d’inhabituel...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, comment ça s’est \n",
        "passé au Lac Courage?\r",
        "Quoi? Tu y vas seulement maintenant?\n",
        "Mais secoue-toi un peu!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_RowanHowWasLakeValor",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how was Lake\n",
        "Valor? Anything to report?\r",
        "What? You’re just going there now?\n",
        "You’ve got to move faster than that!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, comment ça \n",
        "s’est passé au Lac Courage?\r",
        "Quoi? Tu y vas seulement maintenant?\n",
        "Mais secoue-toi un peu!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_DawnHowHasLakeValor",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how was\n",
        "Lake Valor?\r",
        "There’s nothing wrong here.\n",
        "The lake hasn’t changed at all.\r",
        "We haven’t found a legendary\n",
        "Pokémon, either, though..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, rien à signaler \n",
        "au Lac Courage?\r",
        "Il n’y a rien d’inhabituel ici, le lac \n",
        "n’a pas bougé d’un pouce.\r",
        "Et pas de Pokémon légendaire en vue..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerityLowWater_Text_LucasHowsLakeValor",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hiya, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s Lake Valor?\r",
        "There’s nothing wrong here.\n",
        "The lake is ordinary, as usual.\r",
        "There’s no legendary Pokémon,\n",
        "either..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Salut, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Comment ça s’est passé au Lac Courage?\r",
        "Ici, rien à signaler. Le lac est fidèle à \n",
        "lui-même... C’est un lac, quoi.\r",
        "Et aucune trace d’un quelconque \n",
        "Pokémon légendaire."
      ]
    }
  ]
}